      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Advantages of AC"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Transformers operate exclusively on AC and cannot function on DC because DC does not produce a changing magnetic flux.",
        "In a 50 Hz AC cycle, the magnitude of current becomes zero 100 times every second.",
        "Rectifiers are devices used to convert AC into DC, while inverters convert DC into AC."
      ],
      "id": "ifpgdhz"
